L_str_5_d:
    .ascii "\tldr\tx21, [x0, #8]\n\tldr\tx9, [x0, #16]\n\tb\tLBB1_post_beh\nLBB1_no_reply_result:\n\tmov\tx21, xzr\n\tldr\tx9, [x0, #8]\n\tb\tLBB1_post_beh\nLBB1_ingress_check_kind:\n\tldr\tw9, [x20, #24]\n\tcbnz\tw9, LBB1_ingress_user_beh\nLBB1_ingress_no_beh:\n; Phase C / structured exit: message[+8] is heap payload; do not invoke beh(msg,…). phase_e4f rest_for_one.\n\tmov\tx21, xzr\n\tmov\tx9, xzr\n\tb\tLBB1_post_beh\nLBB1_ingress_user_beh:\n; Phase B trial: message[+8] is inline int64; run behavior like a normal dequeue.\n\tldr\tx0, [x20, #8]\n\tldp\tx1, x8, [x19]\n\tcbz\tx8, LBB1_ingress_no_beh\n\tmov\tx2, sp\n\tblr\tx8\n\tldr\tx10, [x0]\n"
